{% comment %}
  The home page is all blocks and no article furniture — a full-bleed hero runs
  straight under the header, so there is no centred page title to push it down.
  Everything below comes from the block region.

  The page still needs exactly one real <h1>: every hero slide heading is an
  <h2>, and every slide bar the first is aria-hidden. A visually-hidden heading
  carrying the same words as the page <title> gives search engines and screen
  readers a real heading without disturbing the design.
{% endcomment %}
<h1 class="visually-hidden">{{ site.name | escape }}{% if site.tagline %} — {{ site.tagline | escape }}{% endif %}</h1>
{% region 'content' %}
